Title: Effectiveness and Safety of Imatinib and Nilotinib in Chronic Myeloid Leukemia: A Single-Center Study From Southern Morocco.
Abstract: The prognosis of chronic myeloid leukemia (CML) has been revolutionized following the advent of tyrosine kinase inhibitors (TKIs); however, access to molecular monitoring, resistance mutation screening, and second- and third-generation TKIs remains limited in resource-constrained countries. The aim of this study was to describe the efficacy and safety profile of imatinib and nilotinib in southern Morocco.

